  "works": {
    "about": "PIX-254: works out on the Reach's roads, on the board beside the age's projects once the story offers them (`needs`, a main quest step, with `line` said until then), and not part of any age: built, they open their `gate` (Gates), and while that gate stands open anyway (a hero already past it) they aren't offered. The river bridge burned on the Night of Ash; Old Wenna sends Brin's best rope with her answer.",
