        "id": "river_bridge",
        "gate": "bridge",
        "name": "Mend the river bridge",
        "blurb": "New planks on the burnt bridge north of town, lashed with Brin's best rope. The road to Blackiron, Greyhold and the Frostgate.",
        "cost": {
          "gold": 80,
          "items": {}
        },
